              "fill": "$wc-stone-300",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 1200,
              "content": "Mix and match lives right under the shirts: each one has its own ‹ › control, so any front pairs with any back (here: Motel chest hit × WestCose or Nothing back). Below, one panel spells out the full kit every design ships with. The left column trades pickers for expertise.",
