              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 1200,
              "content": "Design-first. The shirts stack like product on a table, the selected back piece opens as an artwork file with its real deliverables (vector master, print file, mockup set), and a dock below lets visitors click or shuffle through fronts and backs. Expertise sits as chips; the full asset list runs along the bottom.",
