              "fill": "$wc-stone-300",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 1200,
              "content": "Keeps a systems story (matching the hero's 'Visual Systems' card) but makes it dark and tactile: brand-standards spreads for mark, color, type, and application fanned like a deck on the table.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "$wc-font-body",
              "fontSize": 16,
              "fontWeight": "500"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
