              "fill": "$wc-stone-300",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 1200,
              "content": "Broadest pitch: website, mobile, social, merch, print, and signage launched as one system. Every surface uses real WestCose work, so it doubles as a recap of the whole page.",
